???: [wait=1][speed=0.2][shake rate=10.0 level=2]...Who goes there?
- I'm looking for a place to stay. I've nowhere else to go. 
	???: [speed=0.8][shake rate=10.0 level=2]Our village is untouched by hardship. You're not the first to ask. 
	???: [speed=0.8][shake rate=10.0 level=2]Sure won't be the last. 
	???: [speed=0.8][shake rate=10.0 level=2]Oh, Goddess, merciful, almighty and wise, what shall I do with this one? 
	???: [speed=0.8][shake rate=10.0 level=2]Will he serve and praise, or will he sow discord and doubt amongst our ranks?
	???: [do DialogueFuncs.play_sfx("sfx_crow")][speed=0.8][shake rate=10.0 level=2].[wait=1].[wait=0.5].
	???: [wait=1.5][speed=0.8][shake rate=10.0 level=2]...Fortune smiles upon you, stranger!
	???: [speed=0.8][shake rate=10.0 level=2]The Goddess and our Elders are benevolent. They've let almost everyone in so far, provided they're willing to leave their earthly possessions and sinful ways behind.
	???: [speed=0.8][shake rate=10.0 level=2]Very soon, that won't be possible anymore. There just isn't enough space, food, or water. It saddens us all. Deeply so. 
	???: [speed=0.8][shake rate=10.0 level=2]But you, you were handpicked by the Goddess Herself... 
	???: [speed=0.8][shake rate=10.0 level=2]...And is that the spark of Her Gift I see in your eyes? What a blessed day. What joy. 
	- That's... great!
		???: [speed=0.8][shake rate=10.0 level=2]So it is. 
		???: [speed=0.8][shake rate=10.0 level=2]She provides and cares for us. And she will provide and care for you, too. => but
	- Praise be!
		???: [speed=0.8][shake rate=10.0 level=2]Praise be indeed!
		???: [speed=0.8][shake rate=10.0 level=2]She provides and cares for us. And she will provide and care for you, too. => but
	- Your Goddess showed Herself to me in my sleep. Of course she'd let me in. I'm Her chosen one.
		???: [speed=0.8][shake rate=10.0 level=2]The Goddess very rarely speaks to us mortals. You've been blessed. 
		???: [speed=0.8][shake rate=10.0 level=2]Doubly so, since She's also bestowed Her Gift upon you. 
		???: [speed=0.8][shake rate=10.0 level=2]But don't let that turn your reverence and appreciation into vanity and pride.
		???: [speed=0.8][shake rate=10.0 level=2]For if there's one thing Our Blessed Goddess hates, it's arrogance. => but
	- Whatever you say. 
		???: [speed=0.8][shake rate=10.0 level=2]She speaks through me. I'm a mere vessel. 
		???: [speed=0.8][shake rate=10.0 level=2]She provides and cares for us. And she will provide and care for you, too. 
		???: [speed=0.8][shake rate=10.0 level=2]...In spite of your ignorant attitude. => but
	- Gift? What Gift?
		???: [speed=0.8][shake rate=10.0 level=2]All will be revealed in due time. It's not for me to explain. => but
- Your Goddess told me to come here. I want to join your church. 
